maxChNo3Index = row number of element with third largest value
maxChNo3Value =  value of the maxChNo3Index row
maxChNo4Index = row number of element with smallesst value
maxChNo4Value =  value of the maxChNo4Index row

if \"value\" = 0, the channel is OFF"
